Python SDK (async)Python SDK (sync)Rest API <ol> <li>Cài LangGraph Python SDK:    <pre><code>pip install langgraph-sdk
</code></pre></li> <li>Gửi một message tới assistant (threadless run):    <pre><code>from langgraph_sdk import get_client
import asyncio

client = get_client(url="http://localhost:2024")

async def main():
    async for chunk in client.runs.stream(
        None,  # Threadless run
        "agent", # Tên assistant. Định nghĩa trong langgraph.json.
        input={
        "messages": [{
            "role": "human",
            "content": "What is LangGraph?",
            }],
        },
    ):
        print(f"Receiving new event of type: {chunk.event}...")
        print(chunk.data)
        print("\n\n")

asyncio.run(main())
</code></pre></li> </ol> <ol> <li>Cài LangGraph Python SDK:    <pre><code>pip install langgraph-sdk
</code></pre></li> <li>Gửi một message tới assistant (threadless run):    <pre><code>from langgraph_sdk import get_sync_client

client = get_sync_client(url="http://localhost:2024")

for chunk in client.runs.stream(
    None,  # Threadless run
    "agent", # Tên assistant. Định nghĩa trong langgraph.json.
    input={
        "messages": [{
            "role": "human",
            "content": "What is LangGraph?",
        }],
    },
    stream_mode="messages-tuple",
):
    print(f"Receiving new event of type: {chunk.event}...")
    print(chunk.data)
    print("\n\n")
</code></pre></li> </ol> <pre><code>curl -s --request POST \
